  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the PRSC series is to assist the Republic of Mozambique to: (i)&amp;amp;nbsp;improve business climate and to increase transparency in the management of extractive industries; (ii) strengthen social protection; and (iii) enhance public finance management.</narrative>
